Book Id:
    Custom iterator for Book IDs
    Dictionary comprehension for page counts
    ilters thick books (>300 pages)
    Uses random for page generation
    DEBUG logs for each Book ID
    INFO logs for library and results
    WARNING when no thick books exist
    ERROR if no books generated


Cinema Ticket Booking:
    Custom iterator for Seat Numbers
    Dict comprehension for booking status
    Filters free seats with list comprehension
    ses random to assign booking/available
    DEBUG logs seat generation
    INFO logs bookings and availability
    WARNING if no free seats
    ERROR if no bookings generated


Employee Salary Bonus:
    Custom iterator for Employee IDs
    Dict comprehension for salaries
    Bonus calculation using comprehension
    Uses random for salary generation
    DEBUG logs employee ID generation
    INFO logs salaries and bonuses
    WARNING if no active employees (optional case)
    ERROR if salaries not generated


Hospital Patient Queue:
    Custom iterator for Patient IDs
    Dict comprehension for health status
    Filters critical cases
    Uses random for patient conditions
    DEBUG logs patient ID generation
    NFO logs patient queue and results
    WARNING if no critical patients
    ERROR if no patients generated


Weather Data Logger:
    Custom iterator for Days
    Dict comprehension for daily temperatures
    Filters hot days (>30°C)
    Uses random for temperature values
    DEBUG logs day generation
    INFO logs temperatures and hot days
    WARNING if no hot days
    ERROR if no data generated